  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "We took the rooms next day and were installed there by the second morning.",
      "shot": 0,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 4.13
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "My life had no object in it, and nobody called on me but him.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 6.083,
      "seconds": 4.22
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "For days on end he lay on that sofa and hardly uttered a word from morning to night.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 12.042,
      "seconds": 5.88
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "There was a dreamy, vacant look in his eyes that I could not account for.",
      "shot": 3,
      "at": 19.625,
      "seconds": 5.02
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Then the working fit would take him, and the fiddle scraped half the night.",
      "shot": 4,
      "at": 26.375,
      "seconds": 4.74
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "So one evening I took a pencil and wrote down everything the man knew.",
      "shot": 5,
      "at": 33.125,
      "seconds": 4.99
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Chemistry, profound. Anatomy, accurate. Astronomy, nil — he had never heard of Copernicus.",
      "shot": 6,
      "at": 39.625,
      "seconds": 7.88
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "I could find no trade on earth that wanted all of it, so I burned the list.",
      "shot": 7,
      "at": 49.208,
      "seconds": 6.14
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "On the fourth of March I came down early; he was still at breakfast.",
      "shot": 8,
      "at": 57.375,
      "seconds": 3.86
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "An article said a man's whole history shows in his cuffs and boots.",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 62.542,
      "seconds": 4.3
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Ineffable twaddle, I said, and slapped the magazine down beside the toast rack.",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 68.167,
      "seconds": 5.72
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "sherlock_holmes",
      "text": "You would lose your money. I wrote that article myself.",
      "shot": 11,
      "at": 75.208,
      "seconds": 3.44
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "I had called his own work rubbish over his own toast.",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 80.167,
      "seconds": 3.72
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "sherlock_holmes",
      "text": "I am a consulting detective. The only one in the world.",
      "shot": 13,
      "at": 85.417,
      "seconds": 3.44
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Strangers came at all hours. He called them clients and asked me to step out.",
      "shot": 14,
      "at": 90.375,
      "seconds": 5.38
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Clever, I thought, and conceited past bearing. So I changed the subject and tried him.",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 97.083,
      "seconds": 6.4
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "A big plain-dressed fellow on the far pavement, a blue envelope in his hand.",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 105.208,
      "seconds": 5.16
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "sherlock_holmes",
      "text": "You mean the retired sergeant of Marines.",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 111.875,
      "seconds": 2.77
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Brag and bounce, I thought. He knew perfectly well I could not check a word.",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 116.167,
      "seconds": 5.02
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "A loud knock below. A deep voice in the hall. Heavy boots on our seventeen stairs.",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 123.208,
      "seconds": 6.06
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_retired_marine_sergeant",
      "text": "For Mr. Sherlock Holmes.",
      "shot": 20,
      "at": 131.0,
      "seconds": 2.28
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "And what is your trade, my lad?",
      "shot": 21,
      "at": 134.792,
      "seconds": 2.91
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_retired_marine_sergeant",
      "text": "Commissionaire, sir. Uniform away for repairs.",
      "shot": 22,
      "at": 139.208,
      "seconds": 4.06
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "And before that, my lad?",
      "shot": 23,
      "at": 145.0,
      "seconds": 2.42
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_retired_marine_sergeant",
      "text": "A sergeant, sir. Royal Marine Light Infantry, sir.",
      "shot": 24,
      "at": 149.125,
      "seconds": 4.2
    }
  ]
}